{"id":"e80b7dd8a192e3f3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test.md","title":"NP 补封闭可由一个完备语言的补检验","display":"thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test — NP 补封闭可由一个完备语言的补检验","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test","aliases":["73-thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test"],"display":"thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test — NP 补封闭可由一个完备语言的补检验","depends_on":["[[73-df-binary-co-np]]","[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§11.1, print pp. 484–486; PDF pp. 506–508; local complement-class notation","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Theorem 13.8, p. 342; scan 350","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":11},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-np-conp-complete-complement-test — NP 补封闭可由一个完备语言的补检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1fa0c4e009de5637\" href=\"?note=1fa0c4e009de5637\" title=\"73-df-binary-co-np\">73-df-binary-co-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.1, print pp. 484–486; PDF pp. 506–508; local complement-class notation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 13.8, p. 342; scan 350"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}\\)</span>；补集全集为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2^*\">\\(\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。coNP、NP 完备性和归约见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1fa0c4e009de5637\" href=\"?note=1fa0c4e009de5637\" title=\"73-df-binary-co-np\">73-df-binary-co-np</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"41d5b79d11297576\" href=\"?note=41d5b79d11297576\" title=\"73-df-binary-np-completeness\">73-df-binary-np-completeness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69f4f24da36d1d66\" href=\"?note=69f4f24da36d1d66\" title=\"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one\">73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}np\\text{-}conp\\text{-}complete\\text{-}complement\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}=\\mathsf{coNP}\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\setminus A\\in\\mathsf{NP}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}np\\text{-}conp\\text{-}complete\\text{-}complement\\text{-}test}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{NP}=\\mathsf{coNP}\\leftrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\setminus A\\in\\mathsf{NP}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意 coNP 语言的补属于 NP，可归约到 A；同一归约函数也把原语言归约到 A 的补。若后者在 NP 中，使用多项式归约下的向下封闭得到 coNP⊆NP，再取补得到反向包含。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-co-np","status":"resolved","id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-co-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"69f4f24da36d1d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-co-np","status":"resolved","id":"1fa0c4e009de5637","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}$；补集全集为 $\\mathbf2^*$。coNP、NP 完备性和归约见 [[73-df-binary-co-np]]、[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]、[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"41d5b79d11297576","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{NPC}$；补集全集为 $\\mathbf2^*$。coNP、NP 完备性和归约见 [[73-df-binary-co-np]]、[[73-df-binary-np-completeness]]、[[73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-polynomial-many-one","status":"resolved","id":"